   "key": "§ HRV reference data > Three differences that are not defects",
   "hash": "36c0888478c7b28d",
   "does": "Documents three places a plain reference implementation disagrees with the app without an app defect: SDNN uses N-1; computeTimeDomain gates ectopics (nsr005: 15.96 against 28.98), so the suite compares the unfiltered reference against rmssd(fromCleanRRs:) and compares the pipeline's RMSSD, pNN50 and gate-removed beat count with gated values pinned in the test on every record (computed outside the app in Python from the published 20%-of-local-median rule and kept adjacent pairs), requires at least one record to lose beats, checks a hand-worked twelve-beat series (RMSSD exactly 10 ms) and, on the sixteen records the gate leaves whole, pipeline pNN50 equal to the unfiltered reference; mean HR comes from rolling 10-second windows, so the test asserts agreement in scale.",
